---
description: Project-wide correctness, scope, and verification baseline
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- Inspect repository instructions, manifests, lockfiles, nearby code, and tests before editing.
- Use the project's actual versions and APIs; never guess or upgrade dependencies without approval.
- Make the smallest coherent change and preserve architecture, public behavior, user data, and unrelated worktree changes.
- Preserve or improve type safety, validate trust-boundary data, and do not weaken auth, permissions, or security controls.
- Add focused tests when behavior changes; run relevant format, analysis, type, test, and build checks.
- Inspect the final diff and report exact evidence plus anything not verified.
